    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="c558ba54-449d-5645-9ddd-dcac703adff9" activityNameId="d3bce41d-c35e-56cd-87cf-f3e1b8980c0b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Powder coating, aluminium sheet</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Powder coating, aluminium sheet
The powder inventoried is mainly used in exterior architectural applications. The coating thickness is 80 um. The heat consumption is calculated for a sheet of 2 mm thickness.;
UUID: b3bbff04-9f71-3acc-b827-19bd99e6f9b6
Chromatising of the aluminium sheet, powder coating and heat curing. No transports of the aluminium sheet to the coating plant or back are inventoried.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Chomatising, coating and heat curing. Treatment of the waste water is assumed.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b3bbff04-9f71-3acc-b827-19bd99e6f9b6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
